# Netlify SPA fallback.
#
# Routing happens in the browser: there is no file at /products/iphone-17-pro-max
# on disk, so without this rule Netlify answers a direct link or a hard refresh
# on any route but "/" with its own 404 page — the storefront's own 404 would
# never even load. Serving index.html with a 200 lets React Router read the URL
# and render the right page.
#
# 200, not 301: a redirect would rewrite the address bar and lose the deep link.
/*    /index.html   200
